msgstr "Nema drugih knjižnih oznaka …"

#, python-format
msgid "found: %s"
msgstr "pronađeno: %s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Add active person to bookmarks\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Dodaj aktivnu osobu u knjižne oznake\n"
"%s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Person <b><i>%s</i></b> is not in the current view.\n"
"Do you want to set it active and rebuild view?"
msgstr ""
"Osoba <b><i>%s</i></b> se ne nalazi u aktualnom prikazu.\n"
"Želiš li je postaviti aktivnom te ponovo izraditi prikaz?"

msgid "Change active person?"
msgstr "Zamijeniti aktivnu osobu?"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This graph would contain at least {people_count} people, which exceeds the "
"limit of {people_limit} people. For performance reasons, at least "
"{people_missing} people won't be shown. You can change this limit in the "
"view configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj bi grafikon sadržavao barem {people_count} osoba, što premašuje "
"ograničenje od {people_limit} osoba. Iz razloga performansi, barem "
"{people_missing} osoba se neće prikazati. To se ograničenje može promijeniti "
"u konfiguraciji prikaza."

msgid "Incomplete graph"
msgstr "Nepotpun dijagram"

